{"4402180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Hunter Files: Case One", "steam_appid": 4402180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About this game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Hunter Files: Case One, you step into the world of Nate Hunter, a private detective stuck in a routine of minor jobs and overdue bills. What begins as a seemingly ordinary assignment slowly takes a turn, as a simple case of discreet surveillance develops into a missing person investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a game focused on conversations, puzzle solving, and classic detective work. Along the way, you piece together clues, solve occasionally absurd puzzles, and uncover an unexpected mystery, with a touch of humor woven naturally into the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402180/extras/e17d6a8c7d5ad5d165595b6b9cffabdf.avif?t=1786741421\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402180/extras_big/e17d6a8c7d5ad5d165595b6b9cffabdf.avif?t=1786741421 width=1560 height=604 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the investigation progresses, the game opens up to new locations and longer conversations, slowly widening the scope of the case. What starts as familiar detective work begins to move beyond Nate’s everyday routine, leading into a new setting that changes the direction of the investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hunter Files: Case One focuses on atmosphere, characters, and a carefully paced mystery. It is the beginning of a larger story, designed to stand on its own while laying the groundwork for what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Story driven point and click adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Dialogue focused investigation and character interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Environmental puzzles that reward observation and logical thinking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Inventory based puzzles with logical item combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Carefully paced progression without time pressure or combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Stylized visual presentation inspired by classic detective fiction</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About this game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Hunter Files: Case One, you step into the world of Nate Hunter, a private detective stuck in a routine of minor jobs and overdue bills. What begins as a seemingly ordinary assignment slowly takes a turn, as a simple case of discreet surveillance develops into a missing person investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a game focused on conversations, puzzle solving, and classic detective work. Along the way, you piece together clues, solve occasionally absurd puzzles, and uncover an unexpected mystery, with a touch of humor woven naturally into the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402180/extras/e17d6a8c7d5ad5d165595b6b9cffabdf.avif?t=1786741421\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402180/extras_big/e17d6a8c7d5ad5d165595b6b9cffabdf.avif?t=1786741421 width=1560 height=604 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the investigation progresses, the game opens up to new locations and longer conversations, slowly widening the scope of the case. What starts as familiar detective work begins to move beyond Nate’s everyday routine, leading into a new setting that changes the direction of the investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hunter Files: Case One focuses on atmosphere, characters, and a carefully paced mystery. It is the beginning of a larger story, designed to stand on its own while laying the groundwork for what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Story driven point and click adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Dialogue focused investigation and character interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Environmental puzzles that reward observation and logical thinking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Inventory based puzzles with logical item combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Carefully paced progression without time pressure or combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Stylized visual presentation inspired by classic detective fiction</p>", "short_description": "The Hunter Files: Case One is a story driven point and click adventure about a private detective caught in routine work. What starts as a simple surveillance job slowly turns into a missing person case, told through dialogue, puzzles, and exploration.", "supported_languages": "English, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402180/372629e094d31265b89ec46b7251c473e9c3efee/header.jpg?t=1786741421", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402180/d702ab39e33558947f7cef5214a9fd02289f221d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786741421", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402180/d702ab39e33558947f7cef5214a9fd02289f221d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786741421", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pro